WEBVTT

00:08:59.943 --> 00:09:02.133
where a speech resonated with you,

00:09:02.157 --> 00:09:05.080
or, you know, just any defining experience

00:09:05.104 --> 00:09:08.913
where it clicked and you said,
"Yeah, this is why I'm here."

00:09:09.386 --> 00:09:12.546
DF: There was a story
that the community manager told one day

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:17.631
of someone who was working
at one of the companies in the building

00:09:17.655 --> 00:09:19.855
and he had become really
good friends with them

00:09:19.879 --> 00:09:21.894
and they'd see them every day and he came,

00:09:21.918 --> 00:09:24.525
I think, crying to the main community desk

00:09:24.549 --> 00:09:25.857
and he had lost his job.

00:09:27.599 --> 00:09:32.178
And the community team
mobilized incredibly quickly,